    description: "Concept audit 2026-10-21/22 (pinned dev e9215548f6; write-up ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/concept_audit_10212026/concept-audit-vocabulary-since-0923_10222026.md). F6, agent read (verdict effect NOT traced): cli.py:6774-6775 checks emptiness only for code_execution / dom_injection; its docstring premise (6753-6756) says the no-catalogue gate covers I/O zones, but that gate counts sinks per LANGUAGE (7466-7468). Measured zero-sink zones while the language has a catalogue: database (c, cpp, go, haskell, rust); host_env (c, cpp, go, java, kotlin, scala, objc, swift); ipc (java, kotlin, scala). Input: the shipped untrusted-input-no-database claim (docs/example-claims/generic-taint-claims.yaml:77-87) on a Go repo -- first check whether another gate already withholds it."  # 3294
